  "prefLabel": "Bea 501.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 501.02 Applicability. The rules of this chapter shall apply to any municipality who applies for a HC designation, a housing planning and regulation municipal grant, a housing production municipal grant, or a housing infrastructure municipal grant or loan.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bea500.html"
